WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.875
Stop playback and wait for Saved on stick. Then shut down normally before removing the key.

00:00:04.875 --> 00:00:11.375
Boot without the XMP key to use MPC O S. The loader remains installed; this is the everyday way to switch.

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:16.708
For a full return to stock, keep your official updater and reconnect the Live in update mode.

00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:22.458
In the installer, choose Restore stock three point ten point one, then Check Live and image.

00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:29.500
Review the stock operation, type X M P O S, and click Restore stock yourself. Keep power and USB connected.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:36.708
When it finishes, boot without the key. Check the official version and your usual projects before calling restoration complete.
